Backstage Forever normalization: each build's npcs.json is normalized
separately, then merged newest-first into 978 NPC identities and 1786 bounded
map interaction points (union with exact dedupe, at most eight points per NPC),
names (newest build wins), contributing-file counts (largest single-build
count), the newest build that observed each NPC and per-NPC lastSeen.
Gossip, options, world coordinates, levels, objects, approached entities and
personal records are excluded. Raw file sizes/hashes/metadata and compiled
size/hash are pinned in source-lock.json. No runtime network request is needed.

These historical player interaction points are approximate, not guaranteed
spawns, current NPC presence, access, eligibility or complete coverage. The
lastSeen day belongs to each NPC and differs from file collection dates.
Contributing saved files are not distinct witnesses or confidence ratings.
This separate reference updates with the app and never becomes a matching
current quest pack. The license does not grant rights in Blizzard narrative
text or game assets.
